            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Manure? (ಗೊಬ್ಬರ, gobbara.) A flowerpot? (ಕುಂಡ, kuṇḍa.) A pipe? (ಪೈಪ್, paip.) A pump? (ಪಂಪು, pampu.) A gate? (ಗೇಟು, gēṭu.) A lawyer? (ವಕೀಲ, vakīla.) An engineer? (ಎಂಜಿನಿಯರ್, eñjiniyar.) A postman? (ಅಂಚೆಯವನು, añceyavanu.) A company? (ಕಂಪನಿ, kampani.) A class? (ತರಗತಿ, taragati.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
