            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A report? (ವರದಿ, varadi.) A problem? (ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ, samasye.) News? (ಸುದ್ದಿ, suddi.) Information? (ಮಾಹಿತಿ, māhiti.) A mark? (ಅಂಕ, aṅka.) Geography? (ಭೂಗೋಳ, bhūgōḷa.) A word? (ಪದ, pada.) A sentence? (ವಾಕ್ಯ, vākya.) A barber? (ಕ್ಷೌರಿಕ, kṣaurika.) A washerman? (ಧೋಬಿ, dhōbi.) A pension? (ಪಿಂಚಣಿ, piñcaṇi.) A fine? (ದಂಡ, daṇḍa.) A strike? (ಮುಷ್ಕರ, muṣkara.) An organisation? (ಸಂಸ್ಥೆ, saṃsthe.) A government department? (ಇಲಾಖೆ, ilākhe.)"
